<view class="filter-wrap">
  <view class="search-bar">
    <view class="icon-search"></view>
    <input
      class="search-input"
      placeholder="搜索制度名称或条款关键词"
      placeholder-class="input-placeholder"
      value="{{keyword}}"
      bindinput="onKeywordInput"
      confirm-type="search"
    />
    <text wx:if="{{keyword}}" class="clear-btn" bindtap="onClearKeyword">✕</text>
  </view>

  <scroll-view class="chips" scroll-x enable-flex show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
    <view class="chip {{category === '' ? 'chip-on' : ''}}" bindtap="onPickCategory" data-name="">全部 {{activeCount}}</view>
    <view
      wx:for="{{categories}}"
      wx:key="name"
      class="chip {{category === item.name ? 'chip-on' : ''}}"
      bindtap="onPickCategory"
      data-name="{{item.name}}"
    >{{item.name}} {{item.count}}</view>
  </scroll-view>

  <view class="row-between mt-16">
    <text class="t-xs t-muted">共 {{list.length}} 条结果</text>
    <view class="row gap-8" bindtap="onToggleArchived">
      <view class="switch {{includeArchived ? 'switch-on' : ''}}">
        <view class="switch-dot"></view>
      </view>
      <text class="t-xs t-muted">含已失效制度（{{archivedCount}}）</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="page-body">
  <view wx:if="{{!includeArchived}}" class="notice mt-8">
    <text class="notice-icon">✓</text>
    <view class="flex-1">
      当前展示的 {{activeCount}} 部均为现行有效版本，由行政专员乔姐维护。已失效的历史版本不作为报销依据，需复核时再打开右上开关查看。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view
    wx:for="{{list}}"
    wx:key="id"
    class="card policy-item {{item.effective ? '' : 'policy-item-off'}}"
    hover-class="card-press"
    bindtap="goDetail"
    data-id="{{item.id}}"
  >
    <view class="row-between">
      <text class="t-lg t-bold flex-1 ellipsis">{{item.title}}</text>
      <text class="tag {{item.statusTag}}">{{item.statusLabel}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="row gap-8 mt-12 chip-row">
      <text class="tag tag-grey">{{item.code}}</text>
      <text class="tag tag-grey">{{item.version}}</text>
      <text class="tag tag-grey">{{item.category}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="t-sm t-muted clamp-2 mt-12">{{item.summary}}</view>

    <view class="dashed-divider"></view>
    <view class="row-between">
      <text class="t-xs t-muted">{{item.effectiveDate}} 起生效 · {{item.clauseCount}} 条</text>
      <text class="t-xs t-muted">乔姐 · {{item.updatedLabel}}更新</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{item.expireDate && !item.effective}}" class="t-xs t-muted mt-8">失效日期：{{item.expireDate}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{list.length === 0}}" class="card">
    <view class="empty">
      <view class="empty-title">没有匹配的制度</view>
      <view class="empty-desc">
        换个关键词试试，或者直接到「问答」里用一句话提问。
        现行制度未覆盖的口径，建议找行政专员乔姐确认。
      </view>
      <view class="btn btn-primary-plain btn-sm empty-btn" bindtap="goAsk">去提问</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="foot-note">
    制度由行政专员乔姐维护：新增、改版、停用均以她的正式发布为准。
  </view>
</view>

<view wx:if="{{isAdmin}}" class="fab" bindtap="goAdmin">
  <text class="fab-plus">+</text>
  <text>维护制度</text>
</view>
